# Conformance probe pack for spec 0.94: a kind whose only keys are those of a list's items. Public.
format     conformance-held-list
version    0.94.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       json
kind    k
when    t  k
group   probe.recs  recs
  field  probe.x  x  int
end
